From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: denfry <aseraw115@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:32:57 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add a pool for the off-thread entity tracker check

Adds performance.async-entity-tracker to config/tessera.yml (default false) with a small pool the region thread shares the work with. The region thread takes batches itself, so a busy pool costs nothing, and it spins until no worker is inside a batch. CraftPlayer gets a canSee that does not go through getHandle, which is bound to the owning thread.

